com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":6882819,"digest":"sha256:c7b8e487cbf4491c94b14335327ce0c8b9a13c688a5d972cec7491e14dd95a61","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-06-14T15:27:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T15:27:17Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/aionyx02/keynova/releases/download/v0.7.1/Keynova_0.7.1_x64-setup.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aionyx02/keynova/tarball/v0.7.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aionyx02/keynova/zipball/v0.7.1","body":"# Keynova v0.7.1\r\n\r\nA stability and performance point release. No new features and no breaking\r\nchanges — the daily search-first path is the same, just quieter, faster, and now\r\nguarded by per-push cross-platform CI.\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n\r\n- **No more black console flash.** Subprocess spawns on Windows could briefly pop\r\n  a black console window that stole focus from the launcher. Every spawn now goes\r\n  through `CREATE_NO_WINDOW` (`core::SilentCommandExt` / `.no_window()`), so\r\n  nothing flashes.\r\n\r\n## Performance\r\n\r\n- **Native Windows shell-icon extraction.** App/file icons are now pulled\r\n  directly from the Windows shell instead of one PowerShell process per icon,\r\n  cutting per-result spawn overhead and latency.\r\n- **Memoized hardware probe.** The local-model hardware probe is cached instead of\r\n  re-shelling `wmic` / `nvidia-smi` on every check, removing repeated subprocess\r\n  spawns.\r\n\r\n## CI / Stability\r\n\r\n- **Per-push cross-platform CI.** A new `ci.yml` matrix runs the frontend build →\r\n  `clippy -D warnings` → `cargo test` on `ubuntu-22.04`, `macos-latest`, and\r\n  `windows-latest` on every push. Previously Linux/macOS were only compiled at\r\n  release-tag time, so platform regressions surfaced late; they are now caught on\r\n  push. All three platforms verified green for this release.\r\n- Static review of every `cfg(not(windows))` / macOS / Linux / unix path confirmed\r\n  they degrade gracefully (Err/None/Unavailable) with no panics.\r\n\r\n## Safety Notes\r\n\r\n- The app remains **unsigned**; the signing pipeline is scaffolded but certs are\r\n  not yet configured (SmartScreen / Gatekeeper will still warn).\r\n- AI-generated commands stay **copy-only**; there is no generic shell execution.\r\n- At-rest secrets live in the OS keychain; risky file actions keep their\r\n  preview/confirm gates.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- `npm run lint`\r\n- `npm run build`\r\n- `npm run test`\r\n- `cargo test --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml`\r\n- `cargo clippy --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml -- -D warnings`\r\n- `npm run docs:refresh`\r\n- `npm run verify`\r\n- `git diff --check`"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aionyx02/keynova/releases/337665032","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aionyx02/keynova/releases/337665032/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/aionyx02/keynova/releases/337665032/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/aionyx02/keynova/releases/tag/v0.7.0","id":337665032,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/st